mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>cos</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mi></mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>2</mn><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>14</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo data-mjx-texclass=\"NONE\">⁡</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi>t</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>2.</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Finally, we evaluate the integral as follows:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0\" jax=\"CHTML\" display=\"true\" tabindex=\"0\" ctxtmenu_counter=\"135\" style=\"font-size: 119.4%; position: relative;\"><mjx